The login/logout control disappeared because your custom template overrides the `userlinks` block in the browsable API base template. The `userlinks` block contains the list of links on the right of the header, which by default includes the login/logout links.

To preserve the authentication links while adding your own content, you must use `{{ block.super }}` within the `userlinks` block in your template.

For example:

```html
{% block userlinks %}
    {{ block.super }}
{% endblock %}
```

Using `{{ block.super }}` ensures that you add your links to the existing set rather than replacing the default content entirely.

